OL,3,GNEWSAAldi apologises over parking      
OL,4,Acherry picker at vets                  
OL,6,FA good-natured dispute between a major 
OL,7,Fsupermarket and a veterinary practice  
OL,8,Fhas ended after some jokey posts on    
OL,9,Fsocial media.                          
OL,11,FDerwent Valley Vets, in Matlock in     
OL,12,FDerbyshire, posted that a cherry picker
OL,13,Flinked to the building of a new Aldi   
OL,14,Fnearby was taking up spaces in its     
OL,15,Fsmall car park after it appeared on    
OL,16,FWednesday.                             
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
