OL,3,GNEWSAAldi apologises over parking      
OL,4,Acherry picker at vets                  
OL,6,FNamed "Shiny Blue Lifty McLiftface",   
OL,7,Fthe vets teasingly said: "If the cherry
OL,8,Fpicker is going to be this week's      
OL,9,FSpecialbuy, please let us know" - but  
OL,10,Fthen joked about being "ghosted" by the
OL,11,Fretailer.                              
OL,13,FBy Friday, Aldi responded with an      
OL,14,Fapology and the offer to "donate a     
OL,15,Fwoofing big hamper of pet food to a    
OL,16,Flocal shelter of your choice. Just tell
OL,17,Fthem Santa Paws has come early".       
